title: $:/mf/gen/GUI command/mf:duplicate
catalog: GUI command
target: mf:duplicate
summary: Scan the active repository for byte-identical files (mf duplicate scan)

!! Reference

* Defined by the shell (a builtin)

!! Default keys

* ``e e k`` → ``mf:duplicate keep selection``
* ``e e t`` → ``mf:duplicate trash selection``
* ``e q k`` → ``mf:duplicate keep query``
* ``e q t`` → ``mf:duplicate trash query``
* ``shift+e k`` → ``mf:duplicate keep selection``
* ``shift+e t`` → ``mf:duplicate trash selection``
